      "lyric_translation": "Where the stars wrap around us",
      "range": [31.86, 35.23], "ans": [13]},
    {"lyric": "Geugoseuro gago isseo I’ll be there",
      "lyric_hangul": "그곳으로 가고 있어 I'll be there",
      "lyric_translation": "I’m going there, I’ll be there",
      "range": [35.23, 38.94], "ans": [13]},
    "",
