      "range": [91.82, 95.0], "ans": [13]},
    {"lyric": "Nae ipsureun umjigyeo",
      "lyric_hangul": "내 입술은 움직여, ayy",
      "lyric_translation": "My lips can move",
      "range": [95.0, 97.14], "ans": [13]},
    {"lyric": "Gongheohameun seoroye pyohyeoneuro",
      "lyric_hangul": "공허함은 서로의 표현으로",
      "lyric_translation": "Let’s fill up the emptiness",
      "range": [97.14, 99.64], "ans": [13]},
    {"lyric": "Chaewo uimi itge mandeureo",
